  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2023 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A multiuse powder brush that is designed with a sleek, palm-size handle and tapered tip for both pinpointed and all-over application. <br><b><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Loose Powder<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Sheer<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The Fluffy Brush is thoughtfully designed to offer pinpointed application. Its tapered tip allows you to tap powder onto targeted areas while the fluffy bristles help to achieve a seamless, finish. The palm-sized shape is ideal for first-time powder users and helps to blend product in with ease.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swirl the Fluffy Brush in the cap, working the powder into the bristles so it&rsquo;s evenly distributed. <br>-For pinpointed application on high-shine zones use tapered tip. <br>-For a radiantly diffused look all over the face bounce and roll the fluffy edges of the brush along the skin.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2023 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A multiuse powder brush that is designed with a sleek, palm-size handle and tapered tip for both pinpointed and all-over application. <br><b><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Loose Powder<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Sheer<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The Fluffy Brush is thoughtfully designed to offer pinpointed application. Its tapered tip allows you to tap powder onto targeted areas while the fluffy bristles help to achieve a seamless, finish. The palm-sized shape is ideal for first-time powder users and helps to blend product in with ease.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Swirl the Fluffy Brush in the cap, working the powder into the bristles so it&rsquo;s evenly distributed. <br>-For pinpointed application on high-shine zones use tapered tip. <br>-For a radiantly diffused look all over the face bounce and roll the fluffy edges of the brush along the skin.</div></details>",
